1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 1=

8
00:00:56,859 --> 00:00:57,859
You're awake.

9
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:08,620
I made this for you.

10
00:01:11,099 --> 00:01:12,099
Just eat it.

11
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Don't be scared.

12
00:01:14,260 --> 00:01:15,700
(Yang Cuicui)
I've already chased off those thugs.

13
00:01:18,358 --> 00:01:20,736
(Zhao Dong,
Supreme Lord of Immortal Realm)

14
00:01:25,504 --> 00:01:27,426
(Affection -100)

15
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:29,459
(I cultivate
the Grand Dual Cultivation of Yin-Yang.)

16
00:01:29,879 --> 00:01:32,099
(If any woman sharing
a destined bond with me)

17
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:34,299
(reaches Affection of 90,)

18
00:01:34,459 --> 00:01:38,140
(and we dual cultivate,
my cultivation level will skyrocket.)

19
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:41,840
(But Cuicui's Affection to me
is at rock bottom.)

20
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:44,879
(I need to find a way
to raise her Affection.)

21
00:01:46,379 --> 00:01:48,680
Cuicui, I'm sorry.

22
00:01:49,099 --> 00:01:51,099
I won't mistreat you from now on.

23
00:01:54,739 --> 00:01:56,439
The conditions here are a bit rough.

24
00:01:57,099 --> 00:01:58,140
Just make do for now.

25
00:01:58,379 --> 00:01:59,659
(He said to give me food and shelter)

26
00:01:59,780 --> 00:02:01,120
(to lure me here,)

27
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:03,019
(but then he sold me out.)

28
00:02:03,519 --> 00:02:04,719
(He's really vicious.)

29
00:02:05,579 --> 00:02:08,020
(He's suddenly being so nice to me,
must be up to something.)

30
00:02:08,379 --> 00:02:09,379
Dong.

31
00:02:10,139 --> 00:02:12,379
Oh, no! The officials are here
to assign wives again!

32
00:02:13,620 --> 00:02:14,639
(The Great Qian declines.)

33
00:02:14,860 --> 00:02:15,960
(So as the population.)

34
00:02:16,219 --> 00:02:18,060
(A policy of assigning wives
has been enacted.)

35
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,819
(The government
assigns women of low status)

36
00:02:21,539 --> 00:02:23,099
(to commoners as wives.)

37
00:02:24,419 --> 00:02:26,020
Zhao Laizi, come and get your wives!

38
00:02:26,020 --> 00:02:27,020
Let's go.

39
00:02:27,159 --> 00:02:28,159
Zhao Laizi.

40
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:29,560
This must be fun.

41
00:02:31,060 --> 00:02:32,340
They are pretty.

42
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:34,840
Yeah.

43
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:35,860
Pretty young.

44
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:37,520
Zhao Laizi.

45
00:02:37,780 --> 00:02:39,300
By order of the County Magistrate,

46
00:02:39,819 --> 00:02:41,400
considering your poverty,

47
00:02:41,819 --> 00:02:43,479
you are granted three wives

48
00:02:43,900 --> 00:02:45,180
to strengthen your family line.

49
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:49,088
(Affection -60
Chu Yunxi, Fallen Empress)

50
00:02:49,904 --> 00:02:52,816
(Affection -30
Liu Hanyan, Daughter of an Official)

51
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:56,691
(Affection -50
Su Wan'er, Daughter of a Merchant)

52
00:02:57,719 --> 00:03:01,000
(All these three women
all share a destined bond with me.)

53
00:03:01,460 --> 00:03:02,460
(Excellent!)

54
00:03:03,539 --> 00:03:06,340
More mouths to feed
means more grain tax.

55
00:03:06,759 --> 00:03:10,900
Starting next month,
you must deliver 30 jin of grain.

56
00:03:11,300 --> 00:03:14,360
If you fail,
you'll be sent to the slammer.

57
00:03:14,419 --> 00:03:16,860
One woman of low status
costs 10 jin of grain tax.

58
00:03:16,860 --> 00:03:18,699
Then three women cost Zhao Laizi 30 jin.

59
00:03:19,159 --> 00:03:21,659
- That'd drive Zhao Laizi to death.
- Yeah.

60
00:03:21,659 --> 00:03:23,900
Three years of drought.
How can he get so much grain?

61
00:03:24,620 --> 00:03:26,539
Zhao Laizi, you can't take them.

62
00:03:26,539 --> 00:03:27,599
They look so weak.

63
00:03:27,599 --> 00:03:28,759
- Dong.
- Can't take them.

64
00:03:28,759 --> 00:03:30,860
These three women are delicate

65
00:03:30,860 --> 00:03:31,860
and skinny.

66
00:03:31,860 --> 00:03:33,819
They're all burdens. We can't take them.

67
00:03:33,819 --> 00:03:35,659
Get lost! Nobody asked you.

68
00:03:36,379 --> 00:03:37,879
(Their Affections to me are so low.)

69
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,560
(This man is really vulgar.)

70
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:41,300
(I don't want to marry him.)

71
00:03:41,699 --> 00:03:43,439
(But Father was framed up,)

72
00:03:43,719 --> 00:03:44,719
(Affection -40)
(dismissed from office and imprisoned.)

73
00:03:45,580 --> 00:03:48,300
(My Su family has been wealthy
in business for generations.)

74
00:03:48,939 --> 00:03:51,199
(I didn't expect
I would be reduced to this,)

75
00:03:51,199 --> 00:03:53,120
(Affection -70)
(being judged by lowly thugs.)

76
00:03:53,740 --> 00:03:55,139
(I am the Empress of all times.)

77
00:03:55,699 --> 00:03:56,699
(I endure this humiliation.)

78
00:03:57,060 --> 00:03:58,360
(Affection -90)
(Once I regain my throne,)

79
00:03:58,560 --> 00:04:00,300
(I will exterminate your entire clans.)

80
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:02,840
These three,

81
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:04,960
I'll take them.

82
00:04:07,219 --> 00:04:08,300
He agreed.

83
00:04:08,900 --> 00:04:11,099
He's throwing his life away for women.

84
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,520
Is he crazy?

85
00:04:12,659 --> 00:04:13,659
What a fool.

86
00:04:13,659 --> 00:04:15,560
Zhao Laizi, smart move.

87
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:18,040
Remember,

88
00:04:18,279 --> 00:04:20,560
if you fail
to deliver the grain monthly,

89
00:04:20,939 --> 00:04:22,019
you're dead.

90
00:04:23,819 --> 00:04:24,819
(Based on my memory,)

91
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,839
(the original host has an affair
with Wang Xu's wife,)

92
00:04:27,319 --> 00:04:28,519
(and Wang Xu seeks revenge.)

93
00:04:29,439 --> 00:04:31,639
(But Wang Xu is a bully anyway.)

94
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:33,639
(None of them is good.)

95
00:04:34,899 --> 00:04:37,300
However, when it comes to marriage,

96
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:38,860
it's all about mutual consent.

97
00:04:39,579 --> 00:04:40,839
If they don't want to marry me,

98
00:04:41,279 --> 00:04:43,100
even if it defies the order,

99
00:04:43,819 --> 00:04:45,220
I won't force them.

100
00:04:50,439 --> 00:04:51,439
You three,

101
00:04:52,439 --> 00:04:53,759
are you willing to be my wives?

102
00:04:57,879 --> 00:04:58,879
Zhao Laizi,

103
00:04:59,139 --> 00:05:01,480
they are all of low status.

104
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:03,060
They have no say.

105
00:05:03,319 --> 00:05:04,319
I said,

106
00:05:04,459 --> 00:05:05,500
when it comes to marriage,

107
00:05:05,639 --> 00:05:08,560
if they refuse, I won't force them.

108
00:05:10,459 --> 00:05:11,720
You said it yourself.

109
00:05:11,980 --> 00:05:12,980
Guards!

110
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:14,800
Wait.

111
00:05:16,199 --> 00:05:17,199
I

112
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,000
agree.

113
00:05:20,079 --> 00:05:21,439
(Father is still in prison.)

114
00:05:21,879 --> 00:05:22,879
(If I defy the order,)

115
00:05:23,259 --> 00:05:24,259
(I'll be punished.)

116
00:05:24,860 --> 00:05:26,899
(It might even implicate my family.)

117
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:31,680
I agree too.

118
00:05:36,019 --> 00:05:37,019
Agree.

119
00:05:38,939 --> 00:05:40,079
(Her brows carry grace.)

120
00:05:40,079 --> 00:05:41,120
(Her gaze shows dignity.)

121
00:05:41,660 --> 00:05:42,819
(She tries to conceal it,)

122
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:45,279
(but a hint of imperial grace
lingers in her gaze,)

123
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:46,680
(showing her nobility.)

124
00:05:47,079 --> 00:05:48,720
(Yet within that overwhelming nobility,)

125
00:05:48,899 --> 00:05:50,680
(there's a hint of downfall.)

126
00:05:51,379 --> 00:05:53,040
(Like a fallen ruler)

127
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:54,800
(She must be)

128
00:05:55,519 --> 00:05:57,319
(a fallen empress.)

129
00:05:58,839 --> 00:06:01,279
(Though this woman's clothes
are tattered,)

130
00:06:01,279 --> 00:06:02,560
(her eyes are lively.)

131
00:06:02,860 --> 00:06:04,180
(Her nose is well-defined,)

132
00:06:04,279 --> 00:06:05,420
(hinting at wealth.)

133
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:06,839
(From a merchant family,)

134
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:08,939
(she's astute, but self-interested.)

135
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:11,480
(This woman has delicate features,)

136
00:06:11,639 --> 00:06:12,639
(with a broad forehead.)

137
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,600
(She's from
a scholarly, official family.)

138
00:06:14,839 --> 00:06:16,100
(But the bridge of her nose)

139
00:06:16,379 --> 00:06:17,500
(indicates her family)

140
00:06:17,500 --> 00:06:18,759
(being imprisoned.)

141
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:22,699
Alright, remember,

142
00:06:23,439 --> 00:06:27,240
if you fail to deliver the grain
in time, you're dead.

143
00:06:30,180 --> 00:06:31,980
Zhao Laizi, 30 jin of grain!

144
00:06:32,519 --> 00:06:34,060
You'd better prepare.

145
00:06:34,060 --> 00:06:36,339
- How can he prepare?
- Pretty faces won't fill the belly.

146
00:06:36,339 --> 00:06:38,180
Let's see
how he gathers 30 jin of grain.

147
00:06:39,279 --> 00:06:40,279
Is he

148
00:06:40,519 --> 00:06:43,040
going to sell our bodies for money?

149
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:44,180
Let's leave.

150
00:06:44,860 --> 00:06:46,560
What a miserable life I have.

151
00:06:47,220 --> 00:06:49,300
Can't believe I met such a wicked man.

152
00:06:53,540 --> 00:06:56,019
Cuicui, come out.

153
00:07:02,519 --> 00:07:03,839
(What a despicable man.)

154
00:07:04,259 --> 00:07:05,800
(Affection -100)
(How dare he hit his wife.)

155
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:07,399
(Once my men find me,)

156
00:07:07,879 --> 00:07:09,279
(Affection -100)
(I'll behead him first.)

157
00:07:09,279 --> 00:07:10,980
(Affection -100)

158
00:07:10,980 --> 00:07:12,959
(Their Affections have hit rock bottom.)

159
00:07:13,220 --> 00:07:15,100
(Dual Cultivation
is not an option for now.)

160
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:24,300
Now that you've married me,
we're all family.

161
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:28,420
I wasn't a good man in the past,

162
00:07:29,060 --> 00:07:30,060
but from now on,

163
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:31,660
I will make sure to protect you,

164
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:34,019
and give you enough food

165
00:07:34,519 --> 00:07:35,519
and clothes.

166
00:07:36,279 --> 00:07:37,279
I will give you

167
00:07:37,519 --> 00:07:38,759
whatever you want.

168
00:07:38,759 --> 00:07:39,759
(What arrogance.)

169
00:07:39,759 --> 00:07:41,379
(Even I dare not make such big talks!)

170
00:07:43,100 --> 00:07:45,500
Why don't you all introduce yourselves?

171
00:07:46,439 --> 00:07:47,439
I'm Yang Cuicui,

172
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:48,560
eighteen.

173
00:07:48,839 --> 00:07:49,899
My parents are dead.

174
00:07:50,399 --> 00:07:52,399
He lured me into here yesterday.

175
00:07:53,819 --> 00:07:54,899
That won't happen again.

176
00:07:56,740 --> 00:07:57,740
I'm Su Wan'er,

177
00:07:57,939 --> 00:07:58,939
from Cangxi,

178
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:00,560
of low status,

179
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:01,680
twenty.

180
00:08:04,199 --> 00:08:05,199
I'm Liu Hanyan,

181
00:08:05,699 --> 00:08:07,259
from Huainan, of low status,

182
00:08:08,060 --> 00:08:09,060
nineteen.

183
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:11,120
I'm Xi Yun.

184
00:08:11,300 --> 00:08:13,759
Same origin

185
00:08:13,759 --> 00:08:16,319
and age with her.

186
00:08:17,060 --> 00:08:19,819
Alright. Since Cuicui married me first,

187
00:08:19,899 --> 00:08:20,899
she'll be the first wife.

188
00:08:21,259 --> 00:08:22,259
Wan'er, second.

189
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:23,360
Hanyan, third.

190
00:08:23,819 --> 00:08:25,600
You, youngest.

191
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:26,600
(Outrageous!)

192
00:08:26,879 --> 00:08:28,160
(I don't have many spouses.)

193
00:08:28,379 --> 00:08:29,720
(Yet now I'm his youngest wife?)

194
00:08:30,319 --> 00:08:31,399
(Ridiculous!)

195
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:34,639
(This vulgar man
thinks he's my husband?)

196
00:08:35,100 --> 00:08:36,720
(What a shameless man.)

197
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:38,080
(Dream on!)

198
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:39,519
Five days left to deliver the grain.

199
00:08:39,860 --> 00:08:42,399
How will you handle the 30 jin of grain?

200
00:08:42,580 --> 00:08:43,580
Exactly.

201
00:08:43,899 --> 00:08:46,679
You probably can't
even get 30 jin of bran.

202
00:08:46,879 --> 00:08:48,279
Forget 30 jin of bran,

203
00:08:48,899 --> 00:08:50,899
we don't have half a jin at home.

204
00:08:54,159 --> 00:08:55,480
Maybe we should just split up.

205
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,120
Let's run away.

206
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:59,659
In these chaotic times,
where can you run?

207
00:09:00,019 --> 00:09:02,679
Don't worry. You all share
a destined bond with me,

208
00:09:02,940 --> 00:09:04,159
destined to be my wives.

209
00:09:04,700 --> 00:09:05,700
Just wait for me at home.

210
00:09:05,779 --> 00:09:08,220
Tonight, I'll treat you to a good meal.

211
00:09:08,259 --> 00:09:09,259
(Destined bond?)

212
00:09:09,759 --> 00:09:10,840
(Who do you think you are?)

213
00:09:11,539 --> 00:09:12,539
Let's go, Er Gou.

214
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:15,120
Get up.

215
00:09:20,220 --> 00:09:22,216
In the supreme eternal realm,

216
00:09:22,216 --> 00:09:23,659
(Destined Divine Maiden)
there's only one divine throne.

217
00:09:24,139 --> 00:09:25,580
(We've been husband and wife
for 100,000 years.)

218
00:09:26,299 --> 00:09:28,139
(I have to make you sacrifice for me.)

219
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:29,440
My Lady.

220
00:09:33,299 --> 00:09:35,360
Let me go! Help!

221
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:36,360
Help!

222
00:09:36,620 --> 00:09:37,620
Just behave.

223
00:10:06,100 --> 00:10:08,840
Destined Divine Maiden,
you wicked woman!

224
00:10:09,259 --> 00:10:10,379
How dare you betray me!

225
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:14,519
Once I regain my power,

226
00:10:15,159 --> 00:10:16,940
I won't let you off.

227
00:10:20,519 --> 00:10:21,519
What?

228
00:10:22,399 --> 00:10:23,759
I, the Supreme Lord,

229
00:10:24,879 --> 00:10:26,860
am reborn in the body
of a worthless thug?

230
00:10:30,059 --> 00:10:31,139
Qian, Kan, Gen, Zhen,

231
00:10:31,879 --> 00:10:33,259
Xun, Li, Kun, Dui.

232
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:37,080
Qi Men.

233
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:38,080
Activate!

234
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:40,039
Er Gou, let's go.

235
00:10:46,559 --> 00:10:47,559
Cuicui.

236
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:49,340
You seem afraid of him.

237
00:10:50,100 --> 00:10:52,179
He's a demon.

238
00:10:52,620 --> 00:10:53,620
For money,

239
00:10:53,679 --> 00:10:57,360
yesterday he let
two village thugs rape me.

240
00:10:57,419 --> 00:10:59,419
Let me go! Help!

241
00:10:59,559 --> 00:11:01,299
Help!

242
00:11:01,700 --> 00:11:02,700
No!

243
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:06,200
For such evil, he deserves
to have his entire clan wiped out.

244
00:11:07,259 --> 00:11:09,940
He must have gone out
to find the village thugs

245
00:11:10,860 --> 00:11:13,419
to make us sell our bodies for money.

246
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:17,039
No, we can't endure such disgrace.

247
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:19,200
We can't just sit and wait.

248
00:11:20,179 --> 00:11:21,419
We must fight back.

249
00:11:38,054 --> 00:11:41,645
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

250
00:11:41,645 --> 00:11:44,432
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

251
00:11:45,008 --> 00:11:47,170
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

252
00:11:47,170 --> 00:11:50,016
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

253
00:11:50,016 --> 00:11:53,294
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

254
00:11:53,294 --> 00:11:54,928
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

255
00:11:54,928 --> 00:11:56,992
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

256
00:11:56,992 --> 00:11:58,528
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

257
00:11:58,528 --> 00:12:01,310
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

258
00:12:01,759 --> 00:12:03,664
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

259
00:12:03,664 --> 00:12:09,695
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

260
00:12:10,277 --> 00:12:14,160
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

261
00:12:14,160 --> 00:12:17,385
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

262
00:12:17,897 --> 00:12:20,496
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

263
00:12:20,496 --> 00:12:25,624
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

264
00:12:25,624 --> 00:12:29,152
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

265
00:12:29,152 --> 00:12:32,860
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

266
00:12:32,860 --> 00:12:34,752
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

267
00:12:34,752 --> 00:12:36,829
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

268
00:12:36,829 --> 00:12:39,360
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

269
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:43,397
♪You met the most precious person♪

270
00:12:45,065 --> 00:12:46,928
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

271
00:12:46,928 --> 00:12:49,447
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

272
00:12:49,447 --> 00:12:50,896
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

273
00:12:50,896 --> 00:12:53,198
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

274
00:12:53,198 --> 00:12:55,168
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

275
00:12:55,168 --> 00:12:59,578
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

276
00:12:59,578 --> 00:13:01,120
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

277
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:03,030
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

278
00:13:03,030 --> 00:13:06,304
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

279
00:13:06,304 --> 00:13:09,625
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

280
00:13:09,625 --> 00:13:11,360
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

281
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:15,984
♪Just catch your breath first♪

282
00:13:15,984 --> 00:13:19,734
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

283
00:13:19,734 --> 00:13:23,112
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

284
00:13:23,486 --> 00:13:25,456
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

285
00:13:25,456 --> 00:13:31,203
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

286
00:13:31,203 --> 00:13:34,719
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

287
00:13:34,719 --> 00:13:36,288
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

288
00:13:36,288 --> 00:13:38,598
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

289
00:13:38,598 --> 00:13:40,336
♪From laughter to devotion♪

290
00:13:40,336 --> 00:13:42,392
♪From falling to innocence♪

291
00:13:42,392 --> 00:13:44,240
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

292
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:50,910
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
